### Get all businesses (default sort: NEWEST, default page: 0, size: 20)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses


### Get businesses with pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?page=0&size=5


### Get businesses by owner
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?ownerId=1


### Get businesses by location (matches locationName or address)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?location=Piezisa


### Get businesses by tags (must match all provided tags)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?tags=barber&tags=men


### Get businesses offering a specific service (title contains, case-insensitive)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?service=tuns


### Get businesses by service and price range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?service=tuns&minPrice=30&maxPrice=100


### Get businesses by service and availability date
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?service=tuns&date=2026-11-23


### Get businesses by service, date, and time
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?service=tuns&date=2026-11-23&time=14:00


### Verify priceRange, date, and time are ignored when service is omitted
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?minPrice=30&maxPrice=100&date=2026-11-23&time=14:00


### Sort by name ascending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?sortBy=NAME_ASC


### Sort by name descending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?sortBy=NAME_DESC


### Sort by oldest first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?sortBy=OLDEST


### Sort by price ascending (with service filter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?service=tuns&sortBy=PRICE_ASC


### Sort by price descending (with service filter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?service=tuns&sortBy=PRICE_DESC


### Combined filters + sorting + pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?location=Cluj&service=tuns&minPrice=30&maxPrice=150&date=2026-11-23&time=14:00&sortBy=PRICE_ASC&page=0&size=10


### Validation test: minPrice > maxPrice (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?service=tuns&minPrice=200&maxPrice=50


### Validation test: past date (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?service=tuns&date=2020-01-01